{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "810b8ced3d25ebc17a44d9e7cf66b91baf11f47342191784f184b69ad4f63ec5", "ja": "目指すべきもの", "zh": "该当作目标的事物", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3fbe918cfa615b178ef842127b519ff61a7cf35149c83aaf4849249ba31a7443", "ja": "詩花のステージに刺激を受けた5人は、自分\n達も頑張ろうと意気込むあまり、初日はちょ\nっと失敗してしまう。しかし詩花のフォロー\nもあって気を取り直し、明日はもっといい\nステージにしようと誓い合う。", "zh": "诗花的表演为五人带来刺激，\n让她们下定决心要发愤图强，\n然而过多的热忱反而导致第一天出现小失误。\n但是众人在诗花的鼓励之下重新振作，\n并誓言明天要展现更出色的表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d9853ea058ff6153dec175c57dc5e893f1cdbdbc4768fce2c2d27c7d0ac9cab4", "ja": "（詩花のステージが終わった。清らかながら、\n慈愛にあふれて……言葉が出ないとは、このことだ）", "zh": "（诗花的表演结束了。\n纯洁又充满慈爱……所谓的叹为观止就是这样吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "8e49bda4982eff075f97013f4bcc6828b2406965d1c29fb8bfc124119ec2ef2a", "ja": "うう、なんて神々しいステージなんだろう……。\n私、感動で、さっきから涙が止まりません！　ぐすっ。", "zh": "呜呜，她的表演真是太神圣了……\n我从刚才就感动得一直流眼泪！呜噎。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "ecd74f6c27c402eef05290e0c1a4c8c58e4a945c6f02181821b0996f83d5b9be", "ja": "ホント、かわいいよな～。\nなんかもう、全部まるごとアイドルって感じだったよ！", "zh": "她真的好可爱喔～\n感觉完完全全就是个偶像啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "44dd0193f53b8a5e725a9e6b8523aa7d9472b081d78869a6737a32d183aa2698", "ja": "な、なんでしょう……。\nわ、私たちとは……こ、根本的に、違うのかも……？", "zh": "怎、怎么说才好呢……\n她、她和我们……好、好像根本是不同世界的人……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "9e916920dd5f8d62181fdc37dbf773e119853fd81aeab3434fe370175bc1bdfb", "ja": "あったかい気持ちが、ず～っと伝わってきたよぉ。\nあたしはいっつも必死なんだけどねぇ……。", "zh": "她一～直散发出很温暖的感觉哪。\n不像我老是很拚命呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "860a9eb0c2b95defb1df19032fa9492e016b72c8e240d92a918af71881db4d19", "ja": "アイドルって……。やっぱ、すっげーよな！\nオレ、ウズウズしてきた！　早くステージに出たい～！", "zh": "偶像……真的好厉害喔！\n我已经等不及了！真想赶快上台～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "38958ffbd7513dbb19d412ecaf93ce6e9deec2091ed153ef3d0dfe3a7cb93cb2", "ja": "そうだねぇ！　詩花さんみたいにできるかは、\nわからんけども……がんばらねば！", "zh": "说得对呢～！虽然不知道我们能不能像诗花那样……\n但还是要加油才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "fe25e1bbd4473d3f93fdb85c04a97925d86739601a938c07c2666fe56ed61c82", "ja": "せっかくだから、詩花のいいトコ、なんか取り入れて\nみよっか？　たとえば……アピールの仕方とかさ！", "zh": "既然这样，不如我们试着纳入诗花的优点吧？\n比方说……表现的方式之类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "07ebe09f99ba63629cbe3b2c850c81cce61e796d81cea572eaf8956fc829dfec", "ja": "アピール……詩花さんの……。はっ、あの挨拶は？\nあのステキな挨拶はどうでしょう！？", "zh": "表现……诗花的……啊，那句问候语呢？\n就用那句很好听的问候语如何！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1021_kyakuseki", "source_sha256": "6586ec446f55336932bb1972cfa9b263d758871c53ef0cbf065ed70750742c2c", "ja": "わあああああああ！", "zh": "哗啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1022_026yur", "source_sha256": "723d6ecf9f1b2ae4133bd765a9fb502ef1f25f233455bda07b933579d2babd07", "ja": "み、みなさ～んっ！\nぐ……、グーテンベルクー！", "zh": "各、各位观众～！\nGu……Gutenberg（古腾堡）～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1024_026yur", "source_sha256": "5d9b4c6c618360235b6774812c61d0a8400f9592176841092022383dd71d4840", "ja": "ああっ！？　ごめんなさい間違えました！\nい、今のは聞かなかったことにしてください～！", "zh": "啊啊！？对不起我讲错了！\n请、请大家当作没听到吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1025_047sub", "source_sha256": "8bc0a3b9153d5d2430af157cb590028ca9cad3e52724b50be90c7c9b7d559f22", "ja": "えっと、そうじゃなくて、えっと～！\nぐ……、グランドスラムーーー！", "zh": "呃，不是那个啦，我想想喔～！\nG……Grand Slam（满贯炮）───！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1026_kyakuseki", "source_sha256": "0fe12a071989316acc61ff0819ac8ff0521c3e9256fe8573bee00c6722837174", "ja": "わはははは！", "zh": "哇哈哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1027_p", "source_sha256": "6ffaa6fd3887551379aa611a44c337bab8e1b9a057d148ccd4bcbea29aca6f37", "ja": "おかえり、みんな！　お疲れさま。", "zh": "你们回来啦！\n表演辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1028_026yur", "source_sha256": "7f7c79767a3abd4b720ff4225275981b52af53b2a0ad773f1fd03940b88a6642", "ja": "すみません。\n出だしから思いっきり、失敗しちゃいました……。", "zh": "对不起。\n一开场就彻底搞砸了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1029_047sub", "source_sha256": "80518a376a065c03ba4a01fa985498161e4056cee1bd17a9fc263310dc55d942", "ja": "オレも全然フォローできなくてさ……。\nゴメン、百合子！", "zh": "我也完全没能帮忙打圆场……\n抱歉，百合子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1030_026yur", "source_sha256": "a8e179126f4b293ec9ae24bb80958d53e06ecd8156a6ed44e0f290d57d570c36", "ja": "昴さんのせいじゃありません！　悪いのは、\nつい活版印刷の創始者の名前を叫んだ私です！", "zh": "这不是昴的错！\n错的是不小心喊成活字印刷发明者名字的我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1034_p", "source_sha256": "10331511393a3e07ae4204db0ca14362e230a0b82e8de3cb3702cf505531b040", "ja": "まだ初日だし、落ち込むには早いぞ。\n失敗を繰り返さないように、明日以降に活かそう！", "zh": "今天才第一天，要沮丧还太早啰。\n要记取教训，明天别再重蹈覆辙了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1036_020meg", "source_sha256": "696329b14973a33f469f7bbb288c4b432014da5fd3d517ed471f70cef44afe6a", "ja": "そだね。リハーサル、頑張ろ～！っと。てことで、\nアタシ、飲み物買ってくるよ。みんな適当でいいよね？", "zh": "说得没错，大家努力排练吧～！\n好啦，我去买饮料啰，大家随便就行了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1037_035hin", "source_sha256": "c1db0f0ee2d5c1b85e8a2cdff591340e0954a51373f32c753920e10a49c58ee4", "ja": "あ……あたしも一緒に行くよぉ。\n恵美さんひとりじゃ、持つのも大変だからねぇ。", "zh": "啊……我也一起去吧。\n不然惠美一个人拿，太重了哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1038_045kar", "source_sha256": "fde62d9b57e5974c48c4a0a77f359fb4d37b0ebb713bbe6cac4688dbf5d4f6d0", "ja": "あ、私も……風にも当たりたいから……。\nあの、行ってきますね、{$P$}さん。", "zh": "啊，我也……想去外面透透气……\n那个，我们去买饮料喔，{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1039_p", "source_sha256": "3f0e694b33dda014a37623c1d8e4fa7bc859b3fba4136656e2d83b2a91b6fbab", "ja": "わかった。じゃ、ここで少し待って……ん？", "zh": "我知道了，那我们就先在这里等……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1040_201xxx", "source_sha256": "64a7686f86bd76a97b7b9f4362b2d73f000c4fb396aa46f259afe301f4f30b62", "ja": "{$P$}さん、昴ちゃん百合子ちゃん！\nお疲れさまです♪　すばらしいステージでしたね！", "zh": "{$P$}先生、小昴、百合子！\n表演辛苦了♪是场很棒的演出喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1041_047sub", "source_sha256": "5b5a6cd09e699c57d9f4536818386c4a23b2db59461af217be3bc03ccb09cb0c", "ja": "ああっ、詩花！　……って、もしかして、\nオレたちのステージ見てくれたの！？", "zh": "啊，是诗花！\n……呃，该不会，你看了我们的表演吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1042_026yur", "source_sha256": "e9890c39642401495076a71fbb6070fd9fd542ebe6372dd92b2a77c5e9e25148", "ja": "と、いうことは、最初の失敗も見られて……！\nうう、詩花さん、間違えてマネしてごめんなさい～！！", "zh": "这、这么说，你也看到一开始的失误了……！\n呜呜，诗花，我画虎成犬真的很抱歉～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1043_047sub", "source_sha256": "fc11448106321d54604d241bec676bbb84932b6ad8361015e41976c450a153d8", "ja": "ああっ、そうだった！\nあ、あの、ごめんな詩花！", "zh": "对喔，我都忘了！\n那、那个，抱歉诗花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1044_201xxx", "source_sha256": "03fcbbaea95545b2fda7945a17625d6362af6a374eba4d2d4f7de511ce6f436c", "ja": "えっ？　……あっ、グーテンベルク？\nふふっ、とんでもない！", "zh": "咦？\n……啊，你们是指古腾堡吗？呵呵，怎么会呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1045_201xxx", "source_sha256": "ce2883dba506148463f403f0a74f677d0dfdcb485c34a8516f1a4f19b588e0c6", "ja": "あの挨拶も、その後のステージも。\n最後まで、とっても楽しかったです♪", "zh": "不管是那句问候，还有之后的表演，\n一直到最后我都看得很开心喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1046_026yur", "source_sha256": "1937b1a0159383b8fbfe8dc2212619e92723025b4b1e7b8b23ce7327bb9f70ad", "ja": "そ、そんなはず……。あの、本当ですか？", "zh": "怎、怎么可能……那个，你是认真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1047_201xxx", "source_sha256": "546643300a92d79b34da5f6a9683e20753370657768d0d7172ec9e33eb92593c", "ja": "もちろん！　百合子ちゃんは、とっても表現力が\n豊かで。私も思わず引き込まれて……。", "zh": "当然！百合子有着丰富的表现力。\n连我都不由得看得入迷……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1048_026yur", "source_sha256": "7bf3e8f4fb86ef12200cd87aed53be2e6fb4c3f80d8c19c36154838c867c83a8", "ja": "そ、そんな！　なんだか、恐れ多いです……。", "zh": "怎、怎么会！我不敢当啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1049_201xxx", "source_sha256": "5981ee81bebbbb7d14939b2e6aad4b8a17c3382bc18387a28e41a8a85bf37f06", "ja": "昴ちゃんのダンスも、元気で、しなやかで。\n私も、あんな風にできたらいいのにな……。", "zh": "小昴的舞蹈也很有活力又灵活。\n真希望我也能跳得跟你一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1050_047sub", "source_sha256": "9945ce6130248a5ad980996a498733619aee8039b44b7fb197a673ad399c28e8", "ja": "ホント！？　うわー、なんか照れるな～♪", "zh": "真的吗！？哇～我觉得好难为情喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1051_047sub", "source_sha256": "c11bdf9fa322561425e767ad56b58f05bb3076bb5122c41cdb9e53e830b4f50f", "ja": "でもオレの方こそ、詩花に憧れてるんだぜ！\nこう、女の子っぽくてさ……ホントかわいいよな～！", "zh": "不过我才羡慕诗花呢！\n你的表演很有女人味……真的好可爱喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1052_026yur", "source_sha256": "820bece72c7fc7567df6cffd975d7dd6c39aa1f1dcf075c5ed60bd52fbc5b313", "ja": "わかります！　会場全体が光に包まれたみたいで……\n天使が降臨したのかと思いました！", "zh": "我懂！好像整个会场都笼罩在光芒里一样……\n还以为是天使降临了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1053_201xxx", "source_sha256": "557c7935457895b754c5e7213af3c57576d4b5113012e1c21e73bce0e7683e2d", "ja": "そんな……ふふっ、ありがとうございます♪", "zh": "过奖了……呵呵，谢谢你们♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1054_201xxx", "source_sha256": "8ea3147f748086a342441366d9fc14e54de4607ed526130fce0e3bcdc640acbe", "ja": "あっ、いけない！　もう行かないと……。", "zh": "啊，糟糕！我该走了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1055_047sub", "source_sha256": "61c25a057c8b2cfd95601801b200c2a1c00bbb3707ea77028a4fdf1b1f160abe", "ja": "え～。もうすぐ恵美たちも戻ってくるから、\nもうちょっと待ってれば？　みんなきっと喜ぶぜ！", "zh": "啊～可是惠美她们就快回来了，\n要不要再等一下？她们一定会很开心的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1056_201xxx", "source_sha256": "7df67714e223cee98c5a51347c0fff072fd45dd479d18144fe9933c34c67556e", "ja": "あ、え……えっと……ごめんなさい。\n社長が待っていると思うので……。", "zh": "啊，可……可是……对不起。\n社长应该正在等我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1057_201xxx", "source_sha256": "336f23f904db6fe192e79c80bd470c54a90db33609f33e4529e95d5c708c5d68", "ja": "……はぁ。", "zh": "……唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1058_p", "source_sha256": "7c35399f1faccfc784decd9c378d2454ab0f5ca588f2f2c527afa026b84ee3b1", "ja": "（……ん？）", "zh": "（……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1059_201xxx", "source_sha256": "e59496aa442f8c441893c3e0a8dcf1839eb91bee763bab27a12d120c95b072cb", "ja": "それじゃ、またお話ししてくださいね。\n今日はこれで……失礼しますっ。", "zh": "那么，下次有机会还要再聊喔。\n今天就先这样……失陪了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1060_026yur", "source_sha256": "8638f956cf8f1942304d209d387cefbe4b71dcd8c3159f0f5516047b71f9120b", "ja": "す、昴さん。私たちって今、もしかして……\n詩花さんに、たくさん褒められちゃいました？", "zh": "我、我说昴，诗花刚才是不是……\n对我们赞不绝口？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1061_047sub", "source_sha256": "b178cfed6bbf7c61c0ca5bf264e6ba3d84ac33663bca777b34bbf77a33b2fef3", "ja": "ああ、すっげーうれしかったよな！\nあ、でも……。", "zh": "对啊，超级开心的！\n啊，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1062_020meg", "source_sha256": "58edf22bd2bbc1233f4c208595021a115432dec59a20920573f1c320a894621c", "ja": "たっだいま～！\n……って、どったの？　ニコニコしちゃって。", "zh": "我们回来啰～！\n……咦，怎么了？你们在笑什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1063_047sub", "source_sha256": "472235c12222e741882b88000eb37f2ce544e17f5d9c9e31f83f1e602a8b489b", "ja": "あ、みんな聞いてくれよ！　今、詩花が来てさ、\nオレたちのステージ、良かったって！", "zh": "啊，你们听我说！\n刚才诗花来过，还说我们的表演很精采耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1064_035hin", "source_sha256": "abddbe80bbb8cceb420ddc16b2f6ac22b8cfbc8b64a9fefd5317deb18f941d6e", "ja": "ええっ、わざわざ来てくれたのかい！？", "zh": "什么，她专程跑来的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1065_020meg", "source_sha256": "9a0f011df4f175df7e7ddd4ac133fc022fc31a2442f88564051e5c398e4b748b", "ja": "あっちゃ～、もうちょい早く戻れば会えたんだよね？\nうわ～、ジュース選びで悩まなきゃよかった～！", "zh": "不会吧～所以我们要是早点回来就能见到她了？\n呜～早知道就别犹豫要买哪罐饮料了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1066_045kar", "source_sha256": "33627a94686590107d608db7b77e7a281e74a8b9403049eb848c581c5f5795fa", "ja": "だ、大丈夫だよ、恵美ちゃん。\nまた今度、会えると思うから……♪", "zh": "放、放心，惠美。\n下次一定还有机会能再见面的……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1067_047sub", "source_sha256": "52935376e2ccef4b166bc1889e56e96ca3574bc5169e5be0851d8e25071a01f1", "ja": "そうだよな……みんな、今日のステージは詩花もほめて\nくれたんだけど、やっぱ失敗しちゃったしさ。", "zh": "对啊……虽然诗花称赞我们今天的表演很棒，\n但我们终究还是有失误啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1068_047sub", "source_sha256": "7be3d02b5d4bbffbd87c95e5811e5d845e48256abfdc3a9d9b06872db21569fe", "ja": "だから……明日はもっといいステージにして、\n詩花とお客さんを、ビックリさせようぜ！", "zh": "所以……明天要拿出更棒的表演，\n让诗花和其他观众都大吃一惊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0046_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0046_story_03_1073_p", "source_sha256": "5a208758741be7be179acb21e01188fb23560577c1ca53167b950324e3844b40", "ja": "（みんな、やる気に満ちている。\n新しい出会いが、いい刺激になってるみたいだな！）", "zh": "（大家都充满了干劲，\n看来新的邂逅带来很不错的刺激！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
